  "scope": "The Kitty Unicode placeholder suite alone in one persistent (KeepOnClose, image policy 5) tab on a disposable macOS sidecar: three cases (the tiles two cells show and erasing them, the tile the marks choose and the inheritance rule, and the cells that must paint nothing), over paired original offscreen PNGs and complete cells/modes. No stock collector ran, so there is no stock grade and no Core or common-harness claim; the pinned callbacks are replayed from the retained bundle and stay inconclusive by design. Not measured: an ordinary (non-persistent) tab in this publication (see the ordinary-tab one), a grid whose aspect differs from the image's (where the image sits inside the grid is not specified here), ids above 24 bits (the third diacritic), the inheritance of a nonzero row, relative placements (P=, Q=), scrolling, history and reflow of placeholder cells, a palette or theme background behind the cells, text selection and copy, a second client, remote persistent sessions, other platforms, a restart or reattach with placeholders on screen.",
